{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A party game powered by your imagination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erect your empire, conquer the entire solar system and establish yourself as the ultimate emperor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity to design the ultimate empire in your vision! Every decision you make leaves a lasting legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/7acd3e8e4062dbb1fcb0bc697b3bdfc0.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/7acd3e8e4062dbb1fcb0bc697b3bdfc0.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Wish Is Our Command, Emperor...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From erecting a statue to launching the nuclear chicken, use your terminal console to type or speak your command and watch as your empire executes your brilliant plan... or crashes into the moon trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/d070444b490d6063bbb49df30abe3065.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/d070444b490d6063bbb49df30abe3065.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends Play for Free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>HOST</strong> the game, a purchase of the &quot;Space Conquest AI - AIGM&quot; DLC is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joining the game is free for any of the host's Steam friends who have the base game, which is available <strong>at no cost</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/c54adeb6fd28a5230e4b50fae86aa493.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/c54adeb6fd28a5230e4b50fae86aa493.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Game Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agent designed to consider game state, create and expand lore, and narrate a fun story filled with twists along with animated actions that showcase the impact in game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/7ecf59c130701da7b288f3669df9ffe7.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/7ecf59c130701da7b288f3669df9ffe7.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hallucination? More Like Imagination!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We transformed the worst part of LLM technology\u2014hallucinations\u2014into imagination! If the AI says something happened, then it did. Fiction becomes fact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/9be70e84c9ffbe98755504bda0c86078.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/9be70e84c9ffbe98755504bda0c86078.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Hate AI?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So do we! We paid real people to make this game! All the art, code, and music was authored by humans. We exclusively use AI in the core gameplay loop, and you can choose which AI powers the agent. The game uses a locally-run llama-cpp and piper model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/b6f7564ee458158f798c66237030f1ea.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/b6f7564ee458158f798c66237030f1ea.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571460?t=1753841776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571460?t=1753841776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/f1609725c48283ba099377a00ef3b2f78ed69466/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753841776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/f1609725c48283ba099377a00ef3b2f78ed69466/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753841776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A party game powered by your imagination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erect your empire, conquer the entire solar system and establish yourself as the ultimate emperor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity to design the ultimate empire in your vision! Every decision you make leaves a lasting legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/7acd3e8e4062dbb1fcb0bc697b3bdfc0.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/7acd3e8e4062dbb1fcb0bc697b3bdfc0.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Wish Is Our Command, Emperor...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From erecting a statue to launching the nuclear chicken, use your terminal console to type or speak your command and watch as your empire executes your brilliant plan... or crashes into the moon trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/d070444b490d6063bbb49df30abe3065.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/d070444b490d6063bbb49df30abe3065.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends Play for Free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>HOST</strong> the game, a purchase of the &quot;Space Conquest AI - AIGM&quot; DLC is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joining the game is free for any of the host's Steam friends who have the base game, which is available <strong>at no cost</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/c54adeb6fd28a5230e4b50fae86aa493.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/c54adeb6fd28a5230e4b50fae86aa493.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Game Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agent designed to consider game state, create and expand lore, and narrate a fun story filled with twists along with animated actions that showcase the impact in game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/7ecf59c130701da7b288f3669df9ffe7.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/7ecf59c130701da7b288f3669df9ffe7.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hallucination? More Like Imagination!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We transformed the worst part of LLM technology\u2014hallucinations\u2014into imagination! If the AI says something happened, then it did. Fiction becomes fact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/9be70e84c9ffbe98755504bda0c86078.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/9be70e84c9ffbe98755504bda0c86078.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Hate AI?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So do we! We paid real people to make this game! All the art, code, and music was authored by humans. We exclusively use AI in the core gameplay loop, and you can choose which AI powers the agent. The game uses a locally-run llama-cpp and piper model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/b6f7564ee458158f798c66237030f1ea.avif?t=1753841776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras_big/b6f7564ee458158f798c66237030f1ea.avif?t=1753841776 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Ezra Hradecky"],"dlc":[3803130],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/e1dfd14b44fb786db1eb6e87ac10844f92a8c4c8/header.jpg?t=1753841776","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul